# Default owners for everything in the repo. Replace @your-org/maintainers with
# the team or users that should review changes. The ruleset's pull_request rule
# can be switched to require code-owner review by flipping
# require_code_owner_review to true in .github/rulesets/main.json.
* @your-org/maintainers

# Governance + tooling plane changes warrant extra scrutiny.
/.github/        @your-org/maintainers
/biome.json      @your-org/maintainers
/lefthook.yml    @your-org/maintainers
/.fallowrc.json  @your-org/maintainers
